3. Zep: Temporal knowledge graph (Graphiti), dynamic edge expiration, episodic memory consolidation, entity extraction, automatic profile synthesis.
4. LangMem: Long-term memory primitives for agents, episodic/semantic/procedural memory extraction, background reflection threads, prompt optimization based on past interactions.
